# Production-Ready Code Editor, Save Manager, Folder Lifecycle & Responsive Layout Plan

This plan details the technical design and step-by-step implementation for upgrading the BCE Code Arena editor system (`CodeEditor.tsx`, `BattleArenaClient.tsx`, and `PersonalCompiler.tsx`).

---

## Technical Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph SaveManager["Save Manager & Version Guard"]
        Edit["User Typing in Controlled handleCodeChange"] --> IncVer["Increment saveVersionRef++"]
        IncVer --> StatusUnsaved["Status: Unsaved"]
        StatusUnsaved --> LSBackup["Debounce 100ms: Save localStorage Backup"]
        LSBackup --> SaveTimer["Debounce 1500ms: Execute Save Operation"]
        
        SaveTimer --> AsyncSave["Async Save (Cloud API / IndexedDB / Local Handle)"]
        AsyncSave --> VerCheck{"saveVersion == currentVersion?"}
        VerCheck -- Yes --> ConfirmSave["Status: Saved + Clear localStorage Backup"]
        VerCheck -- No (Stale) --> IgnoreSave["Ignore Stale Response (Do Not Overwrite Newer State)"]
    end
    
    subgraph Lifecycle["Switching & Folder Lifecycle"]
        SwitchAction["Switch File / Problem / Language / Folder"] --> FlushDirty{"Current Item Dirty?"}
        FlushDirty -- Yes --> ImmediateSave["Immediate Flush & Save Previous Item"]
        ImmediateSave --> LoadNew["Load New Item / Folder"]
        FlushDirty -- No --> LoadNew
        
        LoadNew --> CheckBackup{"localStorage Backup Newer than Saved Timestamp?"}
        CheckBackup -- Yes --> RestoreBackup["Restore Backup Content"]
        CheckBackup -- No --> UseSaved["Use Confirmed Saved Content"]
    end

    subgraph ClipboardPolicy["Context-Aware Clipboard Policy"]
        PracticeBattle["CodeEditor & BattleArenaClient"] --> BlockClipboard["Enforce Capture Handlers (Block Copy/Paste/Cut/Right-Click/Drag-Drop, Allow Autocomplete & Shortcuts)"]
        CompilerWorkspace["PersonalCompiler (Cloud & Local)"] --> AllowClipboard["Allow Copy/Paste/Cut & Right-Click Context Menu"]
    end
```

