## Proposed Changes

### 1. Save Manager & Clipboard Utilities

#### [NEW] [saveManager.ts](file:///d:/Institute/BCE/src/features/code-arena/lib/saveManager.ts)
- `saveLocalStorageBackup(key: string, payload: BackupPayload)`
- `getLocalStorageBackup(key: string): BackupPayload | null`
- `clearLocalStorageBackup(key: string)`
- `restoreBackupIfNewer(userId, workspaceId, targetId, language, confirmedSavedTimestamp, backupKey)`
- Monotonic versioning helper (`createVersionGuard()`) to reject out-of-order stale async save responses.

#### [NEW] [clipboardPolicy.ts](file:///d:/Institute/BCE/src/features/code-arena/lib/clipboardPolicy.ts)
- Reusable React capture event handlers for Monaco wrapper container:
  - `onContextMenuCapture`
  - `onCopyCapture`, `onCutCapture`, `onPasteCapture`
  - `onDragStartCapture`, `onDropCapture`
  - `onKeyDownCapture`: Blocks `Ctrl/Cmd+C, V, X`, `Shift+Insert`, `Ctrl+Insert`, `Shift+Delete` while explicitly allowing Monaco navigation, `Ctrl+Space`, autocomplete, Enter, Backspace, and Tab.

