### 2. Practice Problem Editor

#### [MODIFY] [CodeEditor.tsx](file:///d:/Institute/BCE/src/features/code-arena/components/CodeEditor.tsx)
- Integrate `saveManager` version sequence guard (`saveVersionRef`).
